sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Editor as EditorViewModel
    participant Dao as DiaryDao
    participant Bus as AchievementEventBus
    participant Engine as AchievementEngine
    participant Repo as AchievementRepository
    participant Notif as AchievementNotificationManager
    participant Overlay as AchievementCelebrationOverlay
    participant Cross as CrossSystemManager
    participant Home as HomeScreen

    User->>Editor: 保存日记
    Editor->>Dao: insertEntry(entry)
    Dao-->>Editor: entryId
    Editor->>Bus: publish(EntrySaved(entryId, mood, weather, ...))
    Bus-->>Engine: collect(event)  (IO, 串行)
    Engine->>Repo: buildSnapshot()  (previews，不读正文)
    Repo-->>Engine: DiaryStatsSnapshot
    loop 仅受影响的成就
        Engine->>Engine: evaluateKey(key, snapshot, event)
        alt 达成解锁条件
            Engine->>Repo: unlockWithProof(key, entryId, "entry")
            Repo-->>Engine: Achievement(unlockedAt, relatedEntryId)
            Engine->>Notif: notifyAchievementUnlocked(achievement)
            Notif->>Notif: 安静时段 / 去重校验
            Notif-->>Overlay: InAppNotification + CelebrationController.emit
            Overlay-->>User: 克制动效 + in-app 横幅
        else 仅进度变化
            Engine->>Repo: setProgress(key, value)
        end
    end
    Engine->>Cross: updateRecentAchievementUnlock(name)
    Engine->>Cross: updateLevelInfo(levelInfo)
    Cross-->>Home: StateFlow 更新
    Home-->>User: 首页/Widget 展示「刚解锁 / 最接近」

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Screen as AchievementScreen
    participant VM as AchievementViewModel
    participant Repo as AchievementRepository
    participant CDao as AchievementCollectionDao
    participant DB as Room
    participant Case as AchievementDisplayCaseScreen

    User->>Screen: 点击「加入心愿单」
    Screen->>VM: addToWishlist(key)
    VM->>Repo: addToWishlist(key, isPinned=false, isActive=true)
    Repo->>CDao: upsert(WishlistItem)
    CDao->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE wishlist_items
    DB-->>CDao: done
    CDao-->>Repo: Flow emits
    Repo-->>VM: wishlist Flow 更新
    VM-->>Screen: StateFlow 更新 → 角标 / 总览显示

    User->>Case: 拖拽排序 / 设封面
    Case->>VM: setDisplayCaseOrder / setCover(key)
    VM->>Repo: setDisplayCaseOrder / setCover
    Repo->>CDao: upsert(display_case_entries)
    CDao->>DB: persist
    DB-->>VM: displayCase Flow 更新
    VM-->>Case: 刷新网格 + 同步总览封面
